---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy | YAIBOS" description="How YAIBOS handles website analytics, newsletter signups, and contact links.">
  <Header />
  <main class="mx-auto w-full max-w-3xl flex-1 px-4 py-16 text-slate-700 sm:px-6">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900">Privacy</h1>
    <p class="mt-6 leading-relaxed">YAIBOS is run by Samuel Michelot. You can reach us at <a class="text-blue-700 underline" href="mailto:samuel.michelot@gmail.com">samuel.michelot@gmail.com</a> about privacy questions or requests.</p>

    <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">Optional analytics</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">If you accept analytics, we use PostHog's EU service to measure page visits, interactions, and newsletter signups. We do not record sessions or send newsletter email addresses to PostHog. Analytics starts only after you accept. You can change your choice using Analytics Preferences in the footer.</p>

    <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">Newsletter and contact</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">If you subscribe, your email address is sent to our newsletter service at contact.samuelmichelot.com to manage your subscription. Contact links take you to that service, where you choose whether to send a video, audio, or text message. Links to GitHub and other websites take you to those services under their own privacy policies.</p>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
